# Zig build artefacts. These are regenerable and were deliberately not carried
# over from the monorepo, where the four migrated packages had accumulated
# ~115 MB of cache between them.
.zig-cache/
.zig-global-cache/
zig-cache/
zig-out/
zig-pkg/

# Build and test output captured from a shell.
*.log

# Crash reports: `cli.crash.Panic` writes `.cache/crash-<timestamp>.json` beside the
# working directory (`app/cli/main.zig`'s `report_dir`). Those are artefacts of a failure,
# not sources, and a secret could plausibly be in one.
.cache/

# Editor and OS noise.
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
